        <content type="html" xml:base="https://viveksabale1998.github.io/projects/quantum-computing-lab/">&lt;h1 id=&quot;quantum-computing-lab-notebooks&quot;&gt;Quantum Computing Lab Notebooks&lt;&#x2F;h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comprehensive, open-access laboratory notebooks designed for students and researchers exploring fundamental and intermediate quantum computation, circuit composition, quantum algorithms, and introductory quantum machine learning.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;project-actions&quot; style=&quot;margin: 1.5rem 0; display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;&quot;&gt;
