&lt;h2 id=&quot;pushpin-covered-topics&quot;&gt;📌 Covered Topics&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quantum Fundamentals&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;: Superposition, entanglement, Bell state verification, and quantum teleportation.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quantum Algorithms&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;: Deutsch-Jozsa, Grover search algorithm, and Quantum Phase Estimation (QPE).&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quantum Machine Learning&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;: Quantum feature encoding, parameterised circuits, and variational state classification.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;ul&gt;
